      {
        "type": "step",
        "text": "Prepare pie crust and apple pie filling."
      },
      {
        "type": "step",
        "text": "Pour apples into pie crust. Add the other layer of crust on top. Cut four slits on top of crust. Sprinkle sanding sugar on top."
